  <ScenTitle>The Raisa Affair, 1969</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;This scenario takes place after the Six Day War.&amp;nbsp; Tensions between Israel and Egypt remain high.&amp;nbsp; Israel is conducting patrol missions in the eastern Mediterranean&amp;nbsp;in order to prevent any surprise attacks by hostile countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Author's Notes&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
